{"title":"VGOD Nic Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop one of the best nic salts at cheapest price in Kenya! If you're here, you must know how smooth and amazing these Vgod nicotine salts are! Premium quality and perfect taste, simply VGOD brand is famous for. \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"vgod-nicotine-salt-dry-tobacco","title":"VGOD Nicotine Salt - Dry Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003eDry Tobacco Nic Salt Juice by VGOD. Delivering an authentically robust cured tobacco flavor with a satisfying throat hit, VGOD’s Dry Tobacco Nic Salt Juice is frequently praised by fans for its rich and satiating flavor profile. An excellent choice for those who enjoy the iconic flavor of tobacco without an aftertaste of sweetness.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNic Salt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Cubano Black Salt Nic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 55\/45\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Salt Nicotine\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 25mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"25mg\/ without Ice","offer_id":41670490062903,"sku":"VGOD - Dry Tobacco - 25 mg without ice","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ without Ice","offer_id":41670490095671,"sku":"VGOD - Dry Tobacco - 50 mg without ice","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod-dry-tobacco-30ml-nic-salt.jpg?v=1747701662"},{"product_id":"vgod-nicotine-salt-cubano-black","title":"VGOD Nicotine Salt - Cubano Black","description":"\u003cp\u003eVgod Nic Salt Flavor Cubano Black This flavor will have your taste buds delighted at how great this salt nicotine juice is; you’ll appreciate how much flavor you receive from it. On the exhale, a sugary sweet candy flavor fills your taste receptors, relaxing them from the sour green apple flavor; you won’t know what to do with this fantastic salt nicotine flavor.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eYou’ll be reaching for this flavor whenever you crave a sour and sweet combination. This salt nicotine will seamlessly integrate into your daily routine, and you will never leave the house without it. Because of the sugary sweet taste it gives, this salt nicotine will be sure to satisfy your sweet tooth.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNic Salt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Cubano Black Salt Nic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 55\/45\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Salt Nicotine\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 25mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"25mg","offer_id":41670490128439,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Black - 25mg","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670490161207,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Black - 50mg","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/VGOD-Salt-Nic-Cubano-Black.jpg?v=1747701665"},{"product_id":"vgod-nicotine-salt-iced-purple-bomb","title":"VGOD Nicotine Salt - Purple Bomb","descrip