authentic strawberry inhale, this Iced Berry Bomb Nic Salt Juice is elevated with undertones of sweet and sour strawberry belt and subtle notes of frosty mint to make this vivid and refreshing all-day vape. Slightly sour, frosty, and perfectly sweet, if you enjoy bright and uplifting strawberry e-liquids that leave your palate feeling cool and clean, then VGOD’s Iced Berry Bomb Nic Salt Juice just might be your match.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNic Salt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Iced Berry Bomb Salt Nic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 55\/45\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Strawberry, sour belts \u0026amp; mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Salt Nicotine\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 25mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"25mg\/ ICED","offer_id":41670490357815,"sku":"VGOD - Berry Bomb 25 mg iced","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ ICED","offer_id":41670490390583,"sku":"VGOD - Berry Bomb 50 mg iced","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"25mg\/ without Ice","offer_id":41670490423351,"sku":"VGOD - Berry Bomb 25 mg without iced","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ without Ice","offer_id":41670490456119,"sku":"VGOD - Berry Bomb 50 mg without iced","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod-iced-berry-bomb-30ml-nic-salt-juice-box-bottle.jpg?v=1747701671"},{"product_id":"vgod-nicotine-salt-iced-mango-bomb","title":"VGOD Nicotine Salt - Iced Mango Bomb","description":"\u003cp\u003eIrresistibly authentic, VGOD’s Iced Mango Bomb Nic Salt Juice delivers a sweet and radiant burst of mango flavor that dissolves into an icy clean mint exhale. If you’re an iced tropical vape enthusiast, you won’t want to miss out on trying VGOD’s refreshing Iced Mango Bomb Nic Salt Juice today.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNic Salt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Iced Mango Bomb Salt Nic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 55\/45\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Mango \u0026amp; mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Salt Nicotine\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 25mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"25mg\/ ICED","offer_id":41670490587191,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 25 mg iced","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ ICED","offer_id":41670490619959,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 50 mg iced","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"25mg\/ without Ice","offer_id":41670490652727,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 25 mg without iced","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ without Ice","offer_id":41670490685495,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 50 mg without iced","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod-iced-mango-bomb-30ml-nic-salt-juice-box-bottle.jpg?v=1747701675"},{"product_id":"vgod-nicotine-salt-summer-strawberry","title":"VGOD Nicotine Salt - Summer Strawberry","description":"\u003cp\u003eNo complexity, no creaminess, no problems: VGOD’s Summer Strawberry Nic Salt Juice offers a delightfully crisp, clean, and refreshing blend of ripe summer strawberries with none of the added, supplemental flavors standing in the way.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNic Salt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Summer Strawberry Salt Nic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 55\/45\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Strawberry\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Salt Nicotine\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 25mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"25mg","offer_id":41670490718263,"sku":"VGOD - Summer Strawberry - 25mg","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670490751031,"sku":"VGOD - Summer Strawberry - 50mg","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod-summer-strawberry-30ml-nic-salt-juice-25mg.jpg?v=1747701679"},{"product_id":"vgod-nicotine-salt-tropical-mango","title":"VGOD Nicotine Salt - Tropical Mango","description":"\u003cp\u003eVGOD’s Tropical Mango Nic Salt Juice offers a mouthwatering mango treat for those who think of mango as their main go-to. Succulent, ripe, and electrically sweet, if you already think mango e-liquids are the bomb, then you won’t want to miss out on trying this explosively delicious Tropical Mango Nic Salt Juice by VGOD.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-